|====================================|

where <I> = 1 (MOS1) or 2 (MOS2),
<i>, i=1-14 (MOS epochs), i=1-3 (PN epochs) 
and
<j>, j=0-9 (Y-positions);
<m>, m=5-9 (Y-positions);
<n>, n=7-9 (Y-positions);


The latest available canned response files are described at, and available from,
http://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/xmm-newton/epic-response-files. See also
http://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/xmm-newton/epic-files-updates
for further details on the latest update to EPIC RMFs. 



